local-peak-cost
===============

The engine-side data chain (session event folding, usage ledger and backfill
in lib/state.js and lib/usage.js) is derived from dsh-island-go:

  https://github.com/a961282799-crypto/dsh-island-go
  Copyright (c) 2026 dsh-island contributors
  Licensed under the MIT License.

This repository adds peak/off-peak period detection, rate display,
per-turn period tags and the panel layout on top of that base.
